      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Laparoscopy has rapidly become an important diagnostic and therapeutic tool in gynaecological surgery. The entity of chronic pelvic pain is best investigated laparoscopically before any treatment is planned. Often diagnosis and treatment can be a one-stage procedure."},
